<title>ITALY: SOCCER-RESULT OF ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT OF ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Italian Cup</p>
<p>semifinal second leg match played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    Bologna  1   Vicenza   1</p>
<p>Vicenza win 2-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
